## Sekarang Test!

Pastikan Docker Up dan backend jalan, lalu:

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"fullName":"Budi Santoso","email":"budi@test.com","phone":"081234567890","password":"rahasia123"}'
```

| Test | Harapan |
|---|---|
| Register baru | 201 + accessToken + candidate tanpa passwordHash |
| Register email sama | 409 |
| Login benar | 200 |
| Login password salah | 401 |
| Password 3 karakter | 422 |

Lalu cek `npx prisma studio` → tabel `Candidate` → passwordHash harus berupa hash bcrypt (`$2b$10$...`), bukan plaintext.

Kalau semua lolos, bilang **"lanjut"** — kita masuk ke **Langkah 8: auth middleware, `/api/auth/me`, refresh, dan logout** 🔐

